---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import LeadCapture from '../components/LeadCapture.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="SmartUtilBox | 瑞士私人銀行級財務配置工具" currentPath="/">
    <div class="px-4 py-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto space-y-12">

        <!-- Hero Section -->
        <section class="text-center py-12 md:py-20 bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-3xl shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="relative z-10 px-6">
                <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-serif font-bold mb-6 leading-tight">
                    掌握資本流動<br />打造跨越週期的財富護城河
                </h1>
                <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10 leading-relaxed">
                    運用「瑞士私人銀行」級別的財務演算法，為您精準測量通膨侵蝕、房貸套利空間與高階資產 ROI。
                </p>
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
                    <a href="#tools-grid" class="px-8 py-4 bg-white text-slate-900 font-bold rounded-xl hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors shadow-lg">
                        開始免費診斷
                    </a>
                    <a href="/consulting" class="px-8 py-4 bg-transparent border-2 border-slate-500 text-white font-bold rounded-xl hover:border-white transition-colors">
                        預約顧問諮詢
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Abstract background shapes -->
            <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full overflow-hidden z-0">
                <div class="absolute -top-24 -left-24 w-96 h-96 bg-slate-800 rounded-full opacity-50 blur-3xl"></div>
                <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-1/2 h-1/2 bg-emerald-900/20 rounded-tl-full blur-3xl"></div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Tools Grid (Scenario-driven) -->
        <section id="tools-grid" class="pt-8">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900 mb-8 text-center">解決您目前的財務痛點</h2>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">

                <!-- Scenario 1 -->
                <a href="/mortgage" class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-100 shadow-lg shadow-slate-200/50 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-slate-300 transition-all flex flex-col h-full relative overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-10 group-hover:opacity-20 transition-opacity">
                        <svg class="w-24 h-24 text-emerald-600" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3L2 12h3v8h6v-6h2v6h6v-8h3L12 3z"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <div class="relative z-10">
                        <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 text-xs font-bold rounded-full mb-4">房產套利</span>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 group-hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors">多國房貸本息計算機</h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6 flex-grow">正在猶豫是否要使用寬限期？想知道提早還款能省下多少利息？輸入您的貸款條件，秒懂未來的現金流變化。</p>
                        <div class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center">
                            開始試算 <span class="ml-2 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1">→</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </a>

                <!-- Scenario 2 -->
                <a href="/portfolio-roi" class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-100 shadow-lg shadow-slate-200/50 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-slate-300 transition-all flex flex-col h-full relative overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-10 group-hover:opacity-20 transition-opacity">
                        <svg class="w-24 h-24 text-blue-600" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M16 6l2.29 2.29-4.88 4.88-4-4L2 16.59 3.41 18l6-6 4 4 6.3-6.29L22 12V6z"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <div class="relative z-10">
                        <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 text-xs font-bold rounded-full mb-4">資產配置</span>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 group-hover:text-blue-700 transition-colors">投資組合 X-Ray 體檢</h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6 flex-grow">您的資金過度集中於單一資產嗎？上傳您的部位明細，自動繪製視覺化圓餅圖並發出高風險集中警告。</p>
                        <div class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center">
                            匯入部位 <span class="ml-2 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1">→</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </a>

                <!-- Scenario 3 -->
                <a href="/fire" class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-100 shadow-lg shadow-slate-200/50 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-slate-300 transition-all flex flex-col h-full relative overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-10 group-hover:opacity-20 transition-opacity">
                        <svg class="w-24 h-24 text-amber-600" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm1 15h-2v-2h2v2zm0-4h-2V7h2v6z"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <div class="relative z-10">
                        <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 text-xs font-bold rounded-full mb-4">提早退休</span>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition-colors">FIRE 財務自由計算機</h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6 flex-grow">不想工作到65歲？輸入您的月花費與儲蓄率，找出您專屬的「財富自由黃金交叉年份」。</p>
                        <div class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center">
                            預測未來 <span class="ml-2 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1">→</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </a>

                <!-- Scenario 4 -->
                <a href="/inflation" class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-100 shadow-lg shadow-slate-200/50 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-slate-300 transition-all flex flex-col h-full relative overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-10 group-hover:opacity-20 transition-opacity">
                        <svg class="w-24 h-24 text-red-600" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 13h2v-2H3v2zm0 4h2v-2H3v2zm0-8h2V7H3v2zm4 4h14v-2H7v2zm0 4h14v-2H7v2zM7 7v2h14V7H7z"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <div class="relative z-10">
                        <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-red-100 text-red-800 text-xs font-bold rounded-full mb-4">通膨防禦</span>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 group-hover:text-red-700 transition-colors">通膨與購買力計算機</h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6 flex-grow">現金是長期最危險的資產。看看在 3% 的通膨率下，您銀行裡的 1,000 萬在 10 年後實際購買力剩下多少。</p>
                        <div class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center">
                            面對現實 <span class="ml-2 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1">→</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </a>

            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Lead Capture -->
        <LeadCapture />

    </div>
</BaseLayout>
